# A sheet dragged by its top: the workspaces' sheet opened from the name (70%), drawn up to nearly all the screen
# (94%), dragged down past 30%: closed. Then a new chat's station sheet (half the screen, not draggable): dragged down a
# little it comes back, past 80 it closes; opened again, its station tapped (newChat.pick).
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
tap =Dev
until 切换 workspace
wait 600
shot 1-sheet
dragon 0 -300 400 切换 workspace
wait 800
shot 2-full
dragon 0 640 400 切换 workspace
gone 切换 workspace
wait 800
shot 3-closed
tap icon:ling
until 想让 agent 做什么？
wait 800
tap =studio
until 选择运行的 station
wait 600
dragon 0 40 300 选择运行的 station
wait 800
until 选择运行的 station
shot 4-back
dragon 0 200 300 选择运行的 station
gone 选择运行的 station
wait 800
shot 5-closed
tap =studio
until 选择运行的 station
wait 600
tap1 =studio
gone 选择运行的 station
wait 1500
tap =取消
until 端到端测试
